                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "c432bc",
                      "content": "STANDARD OPERATING PROCEDURE (SOP)",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "800",
                      "fill": "#1F1A24",
                      "fontFamily": "Geist",
                      "lineHeight": 1.43
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "b5f9fc",
                      "content": "PENGGANTIAN ROLL PACKAGING & PENANGANAN MINOR STOP MESIN PACKING PB LINE 2",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "700",
                      "fill": "#C2187A",
                      "fontFamily": "Geist",
                      "lineHeight": 1.43
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "a9c43c",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "height": "fit_content",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 10,
                      "padding": 0,
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "c365cc",
                          "content": "1. TUJUAN:",
                          "fontSize": 14,
                          "fontWeight": "700",
                          "fill": "#1F1A24",
                          "fontFamily": "Geist",
                          "lineHeight": 1.43
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "1cb040",
                          "content": "Memastikan waktu ganti roll film packaging tidak melebihi standar TPM 20 menit dan mencegah reject sealer lebih dari 0.5%.",
                          "fontSize": 14,
                          "fontWeight": "400",
                          "fill": "#6B6275",
                          "fontFamily": "Geist",
                          "lineHeight": 1.43
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "f3959e",
                          "content": "2. ALAT PELINDUNG DIRI (APD) WAJIB:",
                          "fontSize": 14,
                          "fontWeight": "700",
                          "fill": "#1F1A24",
                          "fontFamily": "Geist",
                          "lineHeight": 1.43
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "8c5025",
                          "content": "\u2022 Hairnet & Masker Steril Pabrik Makanan \u2022 Sarung tangan anti-panas untuk area sealer heater \u2022 Safety shoes berstandar ESD",
                          "fontSize": 14,
                          "fontWeight": "400",
                          "fill": "#6B6275",
                          "fontFamily": "Geist",
                          "lineHeight": 1.43
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "66de5d",
                          "content": "3. LANGKAH-LANGKAH OPERASIONAL:",
                          "fontSize": 14,
                          "fontWeight": "700",
                          "fill": "#1F1A24",
                          "fontFamily": "Geist",
                          "lineHeight": 1.43
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "e25b39",
                          "content": "1. Tekan tombol PAUSE pada konsol HMI Touchscreen. 2. Masukkan input Downtime Reason: 'Packaging Film Replacement' pada modul HMI 19.3.5. 3. Longgarkan klem spindel roll film lama dan pasang roll film Masako 100g baru. 4. Sejajarkan eye-mark sensor optik dengan toleransi \u00b11mm. 5. Lakukan uji coba 2 kantong (test bag) dan timbang bobot pada digital scale. 6. Tekan tombol RESUME pada HMI dan verifikasi status telemetry kembali HIJAU.",
                          "fontSize": 14,
                          "fontWeight": "400",
                          "fill": "#6B6275",
                          "fontFamily": "Geist",
                          "lineHeight": 1.43
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
